# Alva — the Adventure update

Add a new single-player game mode to Alva, **Adventure**: a 30-level progression mode. It has its own difficulty, **Venture**, which gets stronger with every level. Every 5 levels it also offers **Perquisites**, permanent upgrades the player picks from cards. This prompt is the whole specification. Read all of it before you write any code.

