- Save it in its own versioned localStorage key, `alva.adventure`, following `js/core/settings.js` exactly: one object, a `version`, `MIGRATIONS`, every field validated on read, and a storage that refuses or is missing keeps progress for this visit only and never throws. Shape:
  ```js
  { version: 1, unlocked: 1..31 /* 31 = all cleared */, cleared: [levels], perquisites: { braveSoldier: 0..5, ... }, milestones: { "5": { offer: ["idA","idB"], picked: "idA" | null }, ... }, seed }
